<title>FRANCE: Rouen August 1-21 grain exports at 253,959 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen August 1-21 grain exports at 253,959 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 253,959 tonnes between August 1 and August 21, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 491,000 tonnes in August 1995.</p>
<p>The 253,959 tonnes grain total included 245,316 tonnes of wheat and 8,643 tonnes of barley, they said.</p>
<p>Wheat destinations break down as follows (in tonnes)</p>
<p>    West Africa			    5,250</p>
<p>    Bangladesh			    20,000</p>
<p>    Canary Islands			14,700</p>
<p>    Ethiopia				19,000</p>
<p>    Finland				  2,200</p>
<p>    Britain				 13,280</p>
<p>    Greece				   5,500</p>
<p>    Ireland				  1,510</p>
<p>    Italy				   90,346</p>
<p>    Madagascar			    14,300</p>
<p>    Morocco				 31,880</p>
<p>    Poland				   8,935</p>
<p>    Portugal				 8,250</p>
<p>    Reunion Island			10,165</p>
<p>Barley destinations break down as follows (in tonnes)</p>
<p>    Italy				    1,555</p>
<p>    Reunion Island			 7,088</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 42215432</p>
</text>
